+# Persistent GPU pool (dispatcher/ package; instances stop after IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS). OFF unless SONYA_FLEET_ENABLED=true.
+# The modes it serves are invisible to this per-job dispatcher, so the two pools never fight over a job.
